5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like to live next to these bins! I'll check the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried about the costs for everyone. I'll look into the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We need to keep the peace. I'll check the statements at the residents' meeting and the station block's meeting minutes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I don't want one person doing all the work. I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the truck arrival time from the crew leader.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Fairness is key here. I'll investigate the ward complaint log for this point and the measurements of the five frontages.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
