55,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A sounds tiring, B seems impossible for some houses, and C smells. I'm not sure!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option C is expensive upfront, but maybe it stops the yearly waste. Option B seems fairer for the location.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A will cause fights. Option C leads to arguments over repairs. Option B is the most neutral.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is too much work and too early. Option C is a huge project. I prefer Option B.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A doesn't solve the location problem. Option C is a permanent fix, but Option B distributes the burden.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, but you said some houses are too narrow for the bins. How does Option B work then?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, maybe we can just rotate between the houses that actually have the space?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,That might just create a new group of people who are unhappy. We need a clean solution.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, that's still better than waking up at 7 AM to watch a bin. I'm sticking with B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, it would be a compromise. Even if it's not a perfect rotation, it's better than one person suffering forever.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,"If Option C smells and Option A is a chore, I'll go with B, even if it's a bit messy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll vote for B. It's the most balanced way to handle the location without a huge bill.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I vote for B. It avoids the ""bin police"" conflict and the maintenance fights of a structure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,Definitely B. It's the least amount of daily stress for the organizers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for B. It's the only way to address the complaint log and the unfairness of the current spot.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
